 the Federal Reserve Banks and the Federal Reserve Board.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [297, 714, 1333, 750], \"page_id\": 58}], \"content\": \"TABLE USCC-1.\\u2014Amounts Outstanding and in Circulation, Mar. 31, 1999\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 773, 1488, 1857], \"page_id\": 58}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th colspan=\\\"6\\\">[Source: Financial Management Service]</th></tr><tr><th>Currency</th><th>Total currency and coin (1)</th><th>Total (2)</th><th>Federal Reserve notes 1 (3)</th><th>U.S. notes (4)</th><th>Currency no longer issued (5)</th></tr><tr><td>Amounts outstanding</td><td>$692,580,332,727</td><td>$666,465,772,829</td><td>$665,942,414,837</td><td>$268,715,616</td><td>$254,642,376</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"6\\\">Less amounts held by:</td></tr><tr><td>The Treasury</td><td>95,245,940</td><td>17,299,530</td><td>17,085,787</td><td>20,739</td><td>193,004</td></tr><tr><td>FRBs</td><td>174,655,754,026</td><td>174,227,836,433</td><td>174,227,831,988</td><td>400</td><td>4,045</td></tr><tr><td>Amounts in circulation</td><td>$517,829,332,761</td><td>$492,220,636,866</td><td>$491,697,497,062</td><td>$268,694,477</td><td>$254,445,327</td></tr><tr><th>Coins 2</th><th>Total (1)</th><th>Dollars 3 (2)</th><th>Fractional coins (3)</th></tr><tr><td>Amounts outstanding</td><td>$26,114,559,898</td><td>$2,024,703,898</td><td>$24,089,856,000</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"4\\\">Less amounts held by:</td></tr><tr><td>The Treasury</td><td>77,946,410</td><td>5,878,410</td><td>72,068,000</td></tr><tr><td>FRBs</td><td>427,917,593</td><td>36,369,121</td><td>391,548,472</td></tr><tr><td>Amounts in circulation</td><td>$25,608,695,895</td><td>$1,982,456,367</td><td>$23,626,239,528</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1905, 419, 1921], \"page_id\": 58}], \"content\": \"See footnotes following table USCC-