See footnotes on the following page\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [592, 94, 1046, 130], \"page_id\": 112}], \"content\": \"EXCHANGE STABILIZATION FUND\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1444, 99, 1495, 130], \"page_id\": 112}], \"content\": \"113\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [545, 191, 1089, 236], \"page_id\": 112}], \"content\": \"TABLE ESF-2.\\u2014Income and Expense\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [464, 257, 1173, 285], \"page_id\": 112}], \"content\": \"[In thousands of dollars. Source: Office of the Assistant Secretary of the Treasury for Management]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 302, 1486, 1103], \"page_id\": 112}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th></th><th>Current quarter<br>Sept. 30, 1998, through Dec. 31, 1998</th><th>Fiscal year to date<br>Oct. 1, 1998, through Dec. 31, 1998</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"3\\\">Income and expense</td></tr><tr><td>Profit (+) or loss (-) on:</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Foreign exchange</td><td>1,699,438</td><td>1,699,438</td></tr><tr><td>Adjustment for change in valuation of special drawing rights holdings and allocations<sup>1</sup></td><td>91,602</td><td>91,602</td></tr><tr><td>Interest (+) or net charges (-) on:</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Special drawing rights</td><td>33,530</td><td>33,530</td></tr><tr><td>U.S. Government securities</td><td>197,993</td><td>197,993</td></tr><tr><td>Foreign exchange</td><td>60,081</td><td>60,081</td></tr><tr><td>Income from operations</td><td>2,082,644</td><td>2,082,644</td></tr><tr><td>Net income (+) or loss (-)</td><td>2,082,644</td><td>2,082,644</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 1150, 796, 1235], \"page_id\": 112}], \"content\": \"1 Beginning July 1974, the International Monetary Fund adopted a technique for valuing the special drawing rights based on a weighted average of exchange rates for the currencies of selected member countries. The U.S. special drawing rights holdings and allocations are valued on this basis beginning July 1974. 2 Excludes foreign exchange transactions for future and spot delivery.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [836, 1150, 1494, 1233], \"page_id\": 112}], \"content\": \"Note.\\u2014Annual balance sheets for fiscal years 1934 through 1940 appeared in the 1940 \\\"Annual Report of the Secretary of the Treasury\\\" and those for succeeding years appeared in subsequent reports through 1980. Quarterly balance sheets beginning with December 31, 1938, have been published in the \\\"Treasury Bulletin.\\\" Data from inception to September 30, 1978, may be found on the statements published in the January 1979 \\\"Treasury Bulletin.\\\"\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [355, 87, 1275, 116], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"FINANCIAL REPORT OF THE UNITED STATES GOVERNMENT, EXCERPT\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1441, 85, 1490, 113], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"117\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [206, 196, 1426, 238], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"INTRODUCTION: Financial Report of the United States Government\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [138, 266, 800, 436], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"The following pages are excerpted from the 1998 \\\"Financial Report of the United States Government.\\\" The report and accompanying information, prepared and published annually by the Financial Management Service, are modeled after corporate-type reports and are developed on an accrual basis of accounting.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [138, 436, 801, 523], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"The excerpts represent some of the most noteworthy information contained in the Financial Report. Data for the Financial Report are compiled from Federal program agency ac-\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 266, 1488, 405], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"counting systems governmentwide. Treasury also presents a management discussion and analysis, the customary notes to the financial statements, a section on \\u201cStewardship Information\\u201d and supplemental information, in the complete document.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 408, 1488, 521], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"The General Accounting Office (GAO) is required by law to audit the Financial Report. GAO's report, as well as the complete Financial Report, can be easily accessed through the internet at www.fms.treas.gov/cfs.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 603, 585, 669], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Statement of Operations and Changes in Net Position\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 674, 801, 900], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"The statement of operations and changes in net position reports the results of Government operations. This includes revenues generated by the Government\\u2019s sovereign power to tax, levy duties, and assess fines and penalties. The statement covers the net cost of Government operations, net of revenue earned from the sale of goods and services to the public. It also includes any adjustments and unreconciled transactions that affect the net position.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 905, 541, 936], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Net cost of Government operations\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 938, 801, 1018], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Net cost of Government operations is the cost of operations reported in the statement of net cost, which is gross cost minus earned revenue.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 10, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1025, 792, 1058], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Revenues: financing sources from non-exchange revenue\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 11, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1058, 801, 1172], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"The main source of revenue for Government operations is non-exchange revenue, which consists of taxes and other revenue the Federal Government generates under its governmental powers or receives by donation.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 12, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1179, 486, 1204], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Miscellaneous earned revenue\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 13, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1207, 801, 1318], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Miscellaneous earned revenue consists of exchange revenues from the public with virtually no associated costs. These items include revenues from spectrum auctions, rents and royalties on the Outer Continental Shelf Lands.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 14, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1327, 443, 1353], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Unreconciled transactions\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 15, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1355, 801, 1414], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Unreconciled transactions are adjustments made to balance the change in net position.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 16, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1419, 530, 1450], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Net position \\u2013 beginning of period\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 17, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1450, 801, 1506], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"This amount is the net position reported on the prior year's Balance Sheet.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 18, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1513, 432, 1544], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Prior period adjustments\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 19, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1544, 801, 1629], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Prior period adjustments are made to revise the beginning net position balance due to accounting principle changes and other adjustments.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 20, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1634, 459, 1662], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Net position - end of period\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 21, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1662, 801, 1721], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"This is the amount reported as net position on the current year's Balance Sheet.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 22, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1747, 477, 1780], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Statement of Net Cost\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 23, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1791, 801, 1848], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"This statement shows the net costs of Government operations for fiscal 1998, which is funded by taxation or through\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 24, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 674, 1488, 731], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Federal borrowing. The statement reflects the costs incurred to carry out the national priorities as determined by law.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 25, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 731, 1490, 926], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Cost is divided among major functions, which are the same as in the budget except that the allocation of costs to the functions is based on accounting standards. Thus costs are reported on an accrual basis and allocated differently than in the budget. For example, the costs of pensions and retiree health benefits are allocated among all functions that employ workers rather than a subfunction in the income security function.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 26, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 926, 1490, 1040], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"A description of all functions and the components of net cost for the activities included in the function is located in the supplemental information section of the \\\"Financial Report of the United States Government\\\" as \\\"Net Cost Detail.\\\"\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 27, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 1040, 1490, 1096], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"The statement contains the following three components for each function:\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 28, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [843, 1096, 1333, 1122], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"The gross cost of Government operations;\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 29, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [843, 1122, 1481, 1181], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"The revenues earned from the public for goods and services; and\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 30, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [843, 1181, 1454, 1235], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"The net cost of Government operations, which is the gross cost less the revenue earned.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 31, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 1242, 945, 1270], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Gross cost\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 32, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 1270, 1490, 1355], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Gross cost includes the full cost of the functions. These costs may be directly traced, assigned on a cause and effect basis or reasonably allocated to the function.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 33, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 1365, 1011, 1393], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Earned revenue\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 34, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 1393, 1488, 1450], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"These are revenues that the U.S. Government has earned by providing goods and services to the public at a price.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 35, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 1457, 920, 1485], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Net cost\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 36, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 1485, 1488, 1542], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"The net cost of Government operations is the gross cost less the earned revenues.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 37, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 1549, 1049, 1584], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"Balance Sheet\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 38, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 1596, 1490, 1763], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"This statement shows the operating assets of the Government that were acquired under fiscal 1998, and prior year budgets. These assets remain available as resources to supply Government goods and services in the future. The statement also shows the Government's operating liabilities including debt held by the public.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 39, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [825, 1763, 1490, 1848], \"page_id\": 113}], \"content\": \"It includes some liabilities that have not yet been funded by appropriations. The net position shown in the statement reflects operating assets less liabilities.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 40, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 85, 191, 113], \"page_id\": 114}], \"content\": \"118\", \"description\": null, \"id