nd mass transit accounts, respectively, include the latest estimates received from Treasury's Office of Tax Analysis for excise taxes, net of refunds. They represent net highway receipts for those periods beginning at the close of fiscal year 2010.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [687, 504, 947, 554], \"page_id\": 111}], \"content\": \"Highway Account\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [681, 559, 954, 592], \"page_id\": 111}], \"content\": \"(In billions of dollars. Source: DOT)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [138, 599, 1494, 952], \"page_id\": 111}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>Commitments (unobligated balances plus unpaid obligations, fiscal year 2010)</td><td>52</td></tr><tr><td>less:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Cash balance (fiscal year 2010)</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Unfunded authorizations (fiscal year 2010)</td><td>51</td></tr><tr><td>48-month revenue estimate (fiscal years 2011, 2012, 2013, and 2014)</td><td>137</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 957, 521, 990], \"page_id\": 111}], \"content\": \"Note.\\u2014Detail may not add to totals due to rounding.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [654, 1040, 978, 1077], \"page_id\": 111}], \"content\": \"Mass Transit Account\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [681, 1084, 953, 1120], \"page_id\": 111}], \"content\": \"[In billions of dollars. Source: DOT]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 10, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [138, 1127, 1494, 1478], \"page_id\": 111}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>Commitments (unobligated balances plus unpaid obligations, fiscal year 2010)</td><td>16</td></tr><tr><td>less:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Cash balance (fiscal year 2010)</td><td>2</